  "changes": {
    "body": {
      "from": "OWNER route update: character foundation is now treated as PASS_CANDIDATE; next gate is cross-sheet model consistency, not new isolated BODY/HAIR/HANDS research.\n\nDurable spec will live on `duncan/zorr-studio-r01` as `studio/FULL_CHARACTER_MODEL_LOCK_R02.md`.\n\nScope: prove `SHEET_1 … SHEET_6 -> ONE CHARACTER MODEL`, then continue to costume mechanics, pose mechanics, camera layout, approved line/color/shadow/material state, Golden Keyframe, separated OpenToonz source package, S001 physical shot base, OpenToonz cut.\n\nCharacter lock and S001 shot lock remain separate. `9:16` is S001-specific assumption only until separately confirmed; it is not global production canon.\n\nNo image generation/editing authorized by this issue."
    }
  },
