    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "OWNER route update: character foundation is treated as PASS_CANDIDATE; this tracker exists to prove cross-sheet model consistency rather than reopen isolated BODY/HAIR/HANDS research.\n\nDurable spec: `studio/FULL_CHARACTER_MODEL_LOCK_R02.md`\nFresh audit: `studio/FULL_CHARACTER_MODEL_LOCK_R02_AUDIT_R01.md`\n\nTERMINAL RESULT:\n- `FULL_CHARACTER_MODEL_LOCK_R02 = PASS`\n- no hard cross-sheet conflict found across head/face, hair, body, hands, identity markers or costume attachment points;\n- exact pack bytes/hashes/dimensions/integrity were freshly verified;\n- generic BODY/HAIR/HANDS research remains frozen;\n- allowed downstream OPEN items are recorded explicitly.\n\nPASS meaning is narrow: character model consistency is proven sufficiently to move downstream. This is not final all-production canon, not OpenToonz source readiness, and not S001 shot readiness.\n\nNEXT = `COSTUME_MECHANICS_R01`.\n\nCharacter model lock and S001 shot lock remain separate. `9:16` is S001-specific assumption only until separately confirmed; it is not global production canon.\n\nNo image generation/editing was used for this gate.",
